cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use myastro in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "myastro: a personal astronomy data toolkit with a ledger"
abstract: >-
  Fetch data from public astronomy surveys while keeping a local ledger of what you
  already have: deduplicated downloads, precise cone search over your own archive,
  coverage against full catalogue indexes, integrity auditing, and a TUI.
authors:
